    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40126" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίμαρτυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠρος</span>,
